(3458290, 481661, 53316, '<td valign="top">WOAH! Amazing.  I like this a lot.  Very hardcore guy clements but soft feminine ones too and I think they work well.  Not in reality - I wouldn''t expect to see a person looking like this, you know?   But artistically I think it''s great... the composition just brings the two elements together in a good way.</td>', 'WOAH! Amazing.  I like this a lot.  Very hardcore guy clements but soft feminine ones too and I think they work well.  Not in reality - I wouldn''t expect to see a person looking like this, you know?   But artistically I think it''s great... the composition just brings the two elements together in a good way.', '2007-03-14 01:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
