(3459626, 481342, 15711, '<td valign="top">Sorry, a stuffed animal on a polyester backdrop just really isn''t working for me. Nothing artful or original about it. I think sometimes people feel an urgency to enter a challenge and they just do "any old thing" when they should either bow out of that one, or set it up better.</td>', 'Sorry, a stuffed animal on a polyester backdrop just really isn''t working for me. Nothing artful or original about it. I think sometimes people feel an urgency to enter a challenge and they just do "any old thing" when they should either bow out of that one, or set it up better.', '2007-03-14 09:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
