(3459637, 483617, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ll get criticism from the fundamentalists.  Nothing artful about it. A doll wrapped in some hairy stuff does not an entry make.  Sorry, but don''t just enter something to enter. Props like dolls, stuffed animals, etc have a sense of desparation like "I have to enter but I don''t have anything else to put in the shot." Hope this isn''t harsh, but people want to know why their images score low, so I''m giving my opinion.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ll get criticism from the fundamentalists.  Nothing artful about it. A doll wrapped in some hairy stuff does not an entry make.  Sorry, but don''t just enter something to enter. Props like dolls, stuffed animals, etc have a sense of desparation like "I have to enter but I don''t have anything else to put in the shot." Hope this isn''t harsh, but people want to know why their images score low, so I''m giving my opinion.', '2007-03-14 09:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
