(3467395, 483958, 66524, '<td valign="top">The broken back chair rail offers more meaning to the the photo for me. I hope other voters saw it as well. As a whole, I thought the photo was ill-conceived until I saw the broken rail - very creative!  The wig is too neatly placed - maybe still on his head - say, side ways?  It seems like a party of some truth-or-dare nature.  I mean, he does have his balck sock on and the title might suggest as much.  I am thinking he lost the bet/game?  I might be over reading this, but I like it. -- &gt; 9</td>', 'The broken back chair rail offers more meaning to the the photo for me. I hope other voters saw it as well. As a whole, I thought the photo was ill-conceived until I saw the broken rail - very creative!  The wig is too neatly placed - maybe still on his head - say, side ways?  It seems like a party of some truth-or-dare nature.  I mean, he does have his balck sock on and the title might suggest as much.  I am thinking he lost the bet/game?  I might be over reading this, but I like it. -- > 9', '2007-03-16 20:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
