(3467438, 483909, 18349, '<td valign="top">Great contrasts in the environment and the dress.  The ruby slippers are a nice touch as well.  I''m not fond of the expression...I''d prefer him to be looking off to his left, perhaps deep in thought, but that''s neither here nor there.  Good, solid entry for this challenge.</td>', 'Great contrasts in the environment and the dress.  The ruby slippers are a nice touch as well.  I''m not fond of the expression...I''d prefer him to be looking off to his left, perhaps deep in thought, but that''s neither here nor there.  Good, solid entry for this challenge.', '2007-03-16 21:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3467439, 483815, 18349, '<td valign="top">I think the pose and expression are perfect.  The backdrop needs some work, though...ironing and moving out from it a bit would help to blur it out if you work with a large-enough aperture.  The square wrinkles really kind of kill the mood you have going, but I''m no expert on studio setups anyway.  The pump hanging off the toes is an added bonus...really adds to the mood.  :)</td>', 'I think the pose and expression are perfect.  The backdrop needs some work, though...ironing and moving out from it a bit would help to blur it out if you work with a large-enough aperture.  The square wrinkles really kind of kill the mood you have going, but I''m no expert on studio setups anyway.  The pump hanging off the toes is an added bonus...really adds to the mood.  :)', '2007-03-16 21:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
