(3469461, 483794, 53316, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks. Composition and lighting and tones are excellent and I think it meets the challenge very well.</td>', 'One of my top picks. Composition and lighting and tones are excellent and I think it meets the challenge very well.', '2007-03-18 05:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469462, 483840, 53316, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks. I think probably my favorite. It goes beyond just meeting the challenge, to being a good piece of art.</td>', 'One of my top picks. I think probably my favorite. It goes beyond just meeting the challenge, to being a good piece of art.', '2007-03-18 05:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469463, 483804, 53316, '<td valign="top">AIEEEE.  This is horrifically wonderful.  The pose is awesome and the face reminds me JUST like the guys in the movie "Some Like it Hot".  Way to go. One of my top picks. The face just makes the picture for me.</td>', 'AIEEEE.  This is horrifically wonderful.  The pose is awesome and the face reminds me JUST like the guys in the movie "Some Like it Hot".  Way to go. One of my top picks. The face just makes the picture for me.', '2007-03-18 05:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469464, 483810, 53316, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks. Very delicate and cute, but also bringing to mind very masculine things.</td>', 'One of my top picks. Very delicate and cute, but also bringing to mind very masculine things.', '2007-03-18 05:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469465, 483966, 53316, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks. I love the lighting and tones.</td>', 'One of my top picks. I love the lighting and tones.', '2007-03-18 05:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469466, 483728, 53316, '<td valign="top">Love the unorthodox composition. Pose sorta reminds me of John Cleese, or maybe I just watched some Faulty Towers clips too recently. Overall very well done and one of my top picks.</td>', 'Love the unorthodox composition. Pose sorta reminds me of John Cleese, or maybe I just watched some Faulty Towers clips too recently. Overall very well done and one of my top picks.', '2007-03-18 05:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469467, 482116, 53316, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks. Hair and facial expression are just great, and I like the somewhat muted colors.</td>', 'One of my top picks. Hair and facial expression are just great, and I like the somewhat muted colors.', '2007-03-18 05:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469469, 483865, 53316, '<td valign="top">Would be better, I feel, if it was more in focus but also if it were cropped differently.  The way it is cropped now I feel like I am missing half of what should be there. I would have prefered either a looser crop to include the whole face or a tighter crop to focus more on the lips. What I do like about this shot is that you captured the "crossdressing" in the act of creation, and I think it is a neat approach.</td>', 'Would be better, I feel, if it was more in focus but also if it were cropped differently.  The way it is cropped now I feel like I am missing half of what should be there. I would have prefered either a looser crop to include the whole face or a tighter crop to focus more on the lips. What I do like about this shot is that you captured the "crossdressing" in the act of creation, and I think it is a neat approach.', '2007-03-18 05:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469470, 481169, 53316, '<td valign="top">Pose and lighting are pretty good but what really hurts this shot in my opinion is the negative space. The background, being busy, doesn''t add anything to the composition and detracts somewhat from your subject, so bringing it in for a closer crop would have given this more impact, I think.</td>', 'Pose and lighting are pretty good but what really hurts this shot in my opinion is the negative space. The background, being busy, doesn''t add anything to the composition and detracts somewhat from your subject, so bringing it in for a closer crop would have given this more impact, I think.', '2007-03-18 05:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469471, 483815, 53316, '<td valign="top">For me, what really kills this shot is the background. I find it very distracting from the subject.</td>', 'For me, what really kills this shot is the background. I find it very distracting from the subject.', '2007-03-18 05:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469472, 483726, 53316, '<td valign="top">A less busy background would have given the subject more visual impact. Also, it looks like you put the camera on a table to shoot; cropping out the bottom part would also keep distractions to a minimum.</td>', 'A less busy background would have given the subject more visual impact. Also, it looks like you put the camera on a table to shoot; cropping out the bottom part would also keep distractions to a minimum.', '2007-03-18 05:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469473, 484009, 53316, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like this shot for the challenge.  To me, crossdressing is about trying to portray yourself as the other gender, and although flannel shirts are more of a guy thing, it doesn''t work for me with the chest exposed.</td>', 'I don''t really like this shot for the challenge.  To me, crossdressing is about trying to portray yourself as the other gender, and although flannel shirts are more of a guy thing, it doesn''t work for me with the chest exposed.', '2007-03-18 05:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469475, 482908, 53316, '<td valign="top">Although I do prefer the shots with people in them, this meets the challenge to me as it is a "creative interpretation of the theme."</td>', 'Although I do prefer the shots with people in them, this meets the challenge to me as it is a "creative interpretation of the theme."', '2007-03-18 05:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
