(3475479, 483807, 73633, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the colouring of this photo and also the effect the lighting has. It seems to be a fun photograph and the mischievous expression in the model''s eyes is great.</td>', 'I enjoy the colouring of this photo and also the effect the lighting has. It seems to be a fun photograph and the mischievous expression in the model''s eyes is great.', '2007-03-20 14:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3475498, 481169, 73633, '<td valign="top">It just seems to be too much of a "point and shoot". There is no great composition, there is a reflection of the light in the top right corner which is very distracting and there is just nothing to really look at! Sorry.</td>', 'It just seems to be too much of a "point and shoot". There is no great composition, there is a reflection of the light in the top right corner which is very distracting and there is just nothing to really look at! Sorry.', '2007-03-20 14:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3475506, 482012, 73633, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but it might have worked out a bit better if the composition was slightly better. I dont like the space on the right of the mirror and I would have also preferred the model''s face to be in focus as well as the picture.</td>', 'I like the idea but it might have worked out a bit better if the composition was slightly better. I dont like the space on the right of the mirror and I would have also preferred the model''s face to be in focus as well as the picture.', '2007-03-20 14:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3475524, 483678, 73633, '<td valign="top">Quite a striking photo. I may have prefered a slightly softer colouring (less saturation) and maybe a tighter crop as something about the composition seems to be slightly off.</td>', 'Quite a striking photo. I may have prefered a slightly softer colouring (less saturation) and maybe a tighter crop as something about the composition seems to be slightly off.', '2007-03-20 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3475583, 482283, 53147, '<td valign="top">What an amazing husband you must have that would allow you to dress him up like this and have this image posted for the whole world to see. Wait - did I say amazing? I guess the words amazing and foolish could be interchangeable here. I sure hope for yours and his sake this bad boy ribbons. ;)<br/> <br/>#60 - Way to Go Woman!</td>', 'What an amazing husband you must have that would allow you to dress him up like this and have this image posted for the whole world to see. Wait - did I say amazing? I guess the words amazing and foolish could be interchangeable here. I sure hope for yours and his sake this bad boy ribbons. ;) #60 - Way to Go Woman!', '2007-03-20 15:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3475588, 483804, 73633, '<td valign="top">Fantastic facial expression. Also really like the background but there is something that seems a little akward about the position?</td>', 'Fantastic facial expression. Also really like the background but there is something that seems a little akward about the position?', '2007-03-20 15:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3475934, 483855, 61961, '<td valign="top">My first time voting for a DPC challenge (thought I''d start with a challenge that had fewer entries) and I''m casting my first vote for you!  I don''t have a good sense yet of what the numbers mean, but this is perhaps my favorite in the challenge so I''ll give it a high number.<br/> <br/>I love the ambiguity in this photo.  The guys are clearly masculine and their looks are fierce and natural.  It feels unposed, though I assume they dressed for the photo and this is not their usual garb.<br/> <br/>The skin tones look great against all the black, and there is a sepia-like quality that is not forced.<br/> <br/>Enough blathering, I''d better learn to shorten my comments.  Best of luck!<br/> -- Larry in NYC ("citymars")</td>', 'My first time voting for a DPC challenge (thought I''d start with a challenge that had fewer entries) and I''m casting my first vote for you!  I don''t have a good sense yet of what the numbers mean, but this is perhaps my favorite in the challenge so I''ll give it a high number. I love the ambiguity in this photo.  The guys are clearly masculine and their looks are fierce and natural.  It feels unposed, though I assume they dressed for the photo and this is not their usual garb. The skin tones look great against all the black, and there is a sepia-like quality that is not forced. Enough blathering, I''d better learn to shorten my comments.  Best of luck! -- Larry in NYC ("citymars")', '2007-03-20 17:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3475943, 483804, 48228, '<td valign="top">Really cool shot here.....You are just so dam funny, it makes me laugh.</td>', 'Really cool shot here.....You are just so dam funny, it makes me laugh.', '2007-03-20 17:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3475949, 483644, 61961, '<td valign="top">I like this very much, it has an apropriate ambiguity.  The facial hair and the slightly wary look of the model makes me imagine this is the photographer''s teenage son (and good sport), yet I suppose this could just as easily be someone who regularly goes by a woman''s name.  The colors of the dress, tree, and skin tones against the darker background are beautiful.  Good depth of field.</td>', 'I like this very much, it has an apropriate ambiguity.  The facial hair and the slightly wary look of the model makes me imagine this is the photographer''s teenage son (and good sport), yet I suppose this could just as easily be someone who regularly goes by a woman''s name.  The colors of the dress, tree, and skin tones against the darker background are beautiful.  Good depth of field.', '2007-03-20 17:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3475955, 484009, 61961, '<td valign="top">Very sexy photo and model, and I like the desaturated look.  My only criticism is thematic -- I wouldn''t necessary think she is wearing a man''s shirt were it not for the challenge theme.</td>', 'Very sexy photo and model, and I like the desaturated look.  My only criticism is thematic -- I wouldn''t necessary think she is wearing a man''s shirt were it not for the challenge theme.', '2007-03-20 17:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
