(3476548, 481342, 60862, '<td valign="top">The non-human subject doesn''t bother me.  But this could be much better.  The lighting is very harsh.  Try moving the subject away from the wall to reduce or eliminate the bright reflection.  Also, try it without the light being dead center;  I suspect this is with onboard flash.  Try it with bright lamps nearby, on a tripod, for a longer exposure and softer lighting.</td>', 'The non-human subject doesn''t bother me.  But this could be much better.  The lighting is very harsh.  Try moving the subject away from the wall to reduce or eliminate the bright reflection.  Also, try it without the light being dead center;  I suspect this is with onboard flash.  Try it with bright lamps nearby, on a tripod, for a longer exposure and softer lighting.', '2007-03-20 23:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
