(3479420, 483084, 59029, '<td valign="top">Aw shucks everyone, thanks for the great comments - and I think Bob''s right, many people missed this because I did go straight for full drag as opposed to making it more obvious.<br/> <br/>Maybe next time I''ll do ''turnaround'' drag...that''s when I do FEMALE drag!  Even then I confuse people, LOL!<br/> <br/>As for the crotch-in-yer-face perspective, well, I knew it might offend some.  Oh well.  But let''s face it, many guys prize what''s in their pants above all else, and one of the first things a drag king has to learn is how to change your body language so you are convincing as a man.  <br/> <br/>Many a time I took the Skytrain (in Vancouver) home from a show, very late at night, through very bad neighbourhoods - and for if nothing more than safety''s sake, be very sure I was exuding a strong male vibe.  I never had a problem.<br/> <br/>Oh yeah...I realize now that I look like I''m sleeping.  I''m actually belching.  Next time I better put a *burp* in the title. :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-03-22 11:52:08.</i></td>', 'Aw shucks everyone, thanks for the great comments - and I think Bob''s right, many people missed this because I did go straight for full drag as opposed to making it more obvious. Maybe next time I''ll do ''turnaround'' drag...that''s when I do FEMALE drag!  Even then I confuse people, LOL! As for the crotch-in-yer-face perspective, well, I knew it might offend some.  Oh well.  But let''s face it, many guys prize what''s in their pants above all else, and one of the first things a drag king has to learn is how to change your body language so you are convincing as a man.   Many a time I took the Skytrain (in Vancouver) home from a show, very late at night, through very bad neighbourhoods - and for if nothing more than safety''s sake, be very sure I was exuding a strong male vibe.  I never had a problem. Oh yeah...I realize now that I look like I''m sleeping.  I''m actually belching.  Next time I better put a *burp* in the title. :-)', '2007-03-21 18:46:52.000000', '2007-03-22 11:52:08.000000', 0),
